Smart Event Management Platform — Module 3

Internee: Mahzaib Irshad Internship ID: ZYNVEX-CERT-1049 Program: Web Development Module: 3 of 4 — Event Registration System Submission window: Sep 7 – Sep 13, 2026

📌 About This Module

Module 3 builds directly on the Module 1 homepage and Module 2 event details/search experience. It adds a full registration flow: a validated RSVP form, duplicate-registration prevention, persistent storage of confirmed registrations, and a confirmation screen with a reference code.

✅ What's Implemented in Module 3
 Registration form UI — modal overlay with name, email, phone, and seats-requested fields
 Form opens pre-filled with the correct event title, triggered from the "Reserve Your Seat" button on the details page
 Client-side validation — required name, valid email format, valid phone format, with inline error messages per field
 Duplicate-registration check — blocks the same email from registering twice for the same event (registering for different events with the same email is allowed)
 Registrations persisted to localStorage, keyed with a generated reference code and timestamp
 Confirmation screen shown on successful registration — displays the reference code and number of seats
 Modal state resets correctly each time it's reopened for a new event